.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pvc 1  "pvc 0.1.1" 
.SH NAME
pvc \- A modern CLI for the PVCplus phase\-vocoder toolkit.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\fR [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A modern CLI for the PVCplus phase\-vocoder toolkit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print the resolved parameters/actions without doing anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pvc\-info(1)
Show details of an audio file or a .pva file
.TP
pvc\-legacy(1)
Run an original C tool directly
.TP
pvc\-preset(1)
Manage preset TOML files for pvc run
.TP
pvc\-run(1)
Run a preset, with optional \-\-set overrides
.TP
pvc\-fn(1)
Generate control functions and response files
.TP
pvc\-migrate\-script(1)
Convert a legacy S.* script into a preset
.TP
pvc\-completions(1)
Print a shell completion script
.TP
pvc\-pv(1)
Stretch, transpose, filter, and warp a sound
.TP
pvc\-stretch(1)
Change duration without changing pitch
.TP
pvc\-pitch(1)
Transpose in semitones, keeping the duration
.TP
pvc\-analyze(1)
Write a .pva analysis file, without resynthesis
.TP
pvc\-twarp(1)
Resynthesize along a moving point in a .pva file
.TP
pvc\-freqresponse(1)
Analyze a sound into a .fr response file
.TP
pvc\-filter(1)
Filter with a fixed .fr response file
.TP
pvc\-tvfilter(1)
Filter with a time\-varying .pva analysis file
.TP
pvc\-denoise(1)
Gate out noise learned from part of the input
.TP
pvc\-compand(1)
Compand each bin against a fixed reference file
.TP
pvc\-spectwarp(1)
Compand each bin against its own frame\*(Aqs peak
.TP
pvc\-harmonize(1)
Add transposed copies of frequency bands
.TP
pvc\-envelope(1)
Track amplitude over a frequency band
.TP
pvc\-centroid(1)
Track the weighted mean frequency of a band
.TP
pvc\-flux(1)
Track frame\-to\-frame frequency change in a band
.TP
pvc\-pitchtrack(1)
Track the fundamental frequency over time
.TP
pvc\-convert\-units(1)
Convert amplitude, decibel, Hz, and pitch units
.TP
pvc\-impulseresponse(1)
Write a .ir file from a window of a sound
.TP
pvc\-irconvolver(1)
Convolve or deconvolve a sound with a .ir file
.TP
pvc\-ring(1)
Resonate through a spectral feedback loop
.TP
pvc\-ringfilter(1)
Resonate through a loop with a fixed .fr filter
.TP
pvc\-ringtvfilter(1)
Resonate through a loop with a .pva filter
.TP
pvc\-irconvolvesequencer(1)
Convolve through a morphing series of .ir files
.TP
pvc\-convolver(1)
Multiply a sound\*(Aqs spectrum by a .pva file
.TP
pvc\-peakformant(1)
Track the loudest bin\*(Aqs frequency over time
.TP
pvc\-specflattracker(1)
Track how noise\-like or tonal each frame is
.TP
pvc\-spectralextractor(1)
Split a sound into its tonal and noise parts
.TP
pvc\-delayfilter(1)
Delay each bin by its own response\-driven time
.TP
pvc\-filtdeviator(1)
Filter, plus per\-bin delay and frequency deviation
.TP
pvc\-tvfiltdeviator(1)
Time\-varying filter, plus delay and deviation
.TP
pvc\-ratechanger(1)
Resample at a variable rate (varispeed)
.TP
pvc\-inharmonator(1)
Remap partials onto a table of target partials
.TP
pvc\-formantsmapper(1)
Remap source formants onto target formants
.TP
pvc\-spectrummapper(1)
Track formant peaks into continuous tracks
.TP
pvc\-chordmapperplus(1)
Synthesize chords from a table of tones
.TP
pvc\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Time and pitch:
  pv                   Stretch, transpose, filter, and warp a sound
  stretch              Change duration without changing pitch
  pitch                Transpose in semitones, keeping the duration
  analyze              Write a .pva analysis file, without resynthesis
  twarp                Resynthesize along a moving point in a .pva file
  ratechanger          Resample at a variable rate (varispeed)

Filtering and convolution:
  freqresponse         Analyze a sound into a .fr response file
  filter               Filter with a fixed .fr response file
  tvfilter             Filter with a time\-varying .pva analysis file
  denoise              Gate out noise learned from part of the input
  convolver            Multiply a sound\*(Aqs spectrum by a .pva file
  impulseresponse      Write a .ir file from a window of a sound
  irconvolver          Convolve or deconvolve a sound with a .ir file
  irconvolvesequencer  Convolve through a morphing series of .ir files
  spectralextractor    Split a sound into its tonal and noise parts

Amplitude warping:
  compand              Compand each bin against a fixed reference file
  spectwarp            Compand each bin against its own frame\*(Aqs peak

Additive synthesis:
  harmonize            Add transposed copies of frequency bands
  inharmonator         Remap partials onto a table of target partials
  chordmapperplus      Synthesize chords from a table of tones
  formantsmapper       Remap source formants onto target formants

Resonance and reverb:
  ring                 Resonate through a spectral feedback loop
  ringfilter           Resonate through a loop with a fixed .fr filter
  ringtvfilter         Resonate through a loop with a .pva filter

Frequency deviation:
  delayfilter          Delay each bin by its own response\-driven time
  filtdeviator         Filter, plus per\-bin delay and frequency deviation
  tvfiltdeviator       Time\-varying filter, plus delay and deviation

Feature extraction:
  envelope             Track amplitude over a frequency band
  centroid             Track the weighted mean frequency of a band
  flux                 Track frame\-to\-frame frequency change in a band
  pitchtrack           Track the fundamental frequency over time
  peakformant          Track the loudest bin\*(Aqs frequency over time
  specflattracker      Track how noise\-like or tonal each frame is
  spectrummapper       Track formant peaks into continuous tracks

Control functions:
  fn                   Generate control functions and response files

Presets and scripting:
  preset               Manage preset TOML files for pvc run
  run                  Run a preset, with optional \-\-set overrides
  migrate\-script       Convert a legacy S.* script into a preset

Utilities:
  info                 Show details of an audio file or a .pva file
  convert\-units        Convert amplitude, decibel, Hz, and pitch units
  legacy               Run an original C tool directly
  completions          Print a shell completion script
  help                 Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.1
